    "#### The relationship between the different Edie domain size\n",
    "- To explain the relationship above, $\\frac{\\sigma_1^2 \\cdot R_1}{M_1 \\cdot N_1}=\\frac{\\sigma_2^2 \\cdot R_1 \\cdot R_2}{(M_1 \\cdot N_1) \\cdot (M_2 \\cdot N_2)}$ needs to be explained first.\n",
