   "source": [
    "### Detector Health Evaluation\n",
    "- Detector health index: the ratio of CV less than upper threshold * 100\n",
    "    - 100: all CVs in a specific date are less than upper threshold: perfect functioning.\n",
    "    - The upper threshold: 99% critical value(0.123)\n",
    "- I expect this this threshold will increase when we implement I-24."
   ]
  },
